*.lua linguist-vendored
*.html linguist-vendored
*.htm linguist-vendored
*.tex linguist-vendored
*.latex linguist-vendored
*.typ linguist-vendored
*.typst linguist-vendored
*.mdx linguist-vendored
*.qmd linguist-vendored
*.rmd linguist-vendored
*.mmd linguist-vendored
*.mermaid linguist-vendored
*.dot linguist-vendored
*.gv linguist-vendored
*.csv linguist-vendored
*.tsv linguist-vendored
*.vl linguist-vendored
*.vega linguist-vendored
*.plotly linguist-vendored
